            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#1b6d48] font-bold text-sm shrink-0">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-[#171513] font-semibold">100% Shower, Gym &amp; Pool Safe:</strong>
